Title: Deleted organization members are still able to delete chats and contacts

Summary:
deleted user can delete chats after deletion

Steps To Reproduce:
1. go to info.wavelo.com
2. register with acc A & B
3. invite B to A org and don't give him any permissions => it's a bug I submitted before
4. B : go to https://chat.sarbacane.com will permit you to access anything on ORG.
5. owner delete me from chat.wavelo.com
6. after I was deleted I still can delete the contacts and chats
7. if chat didn't delete from the first time make delete action again and will be deleted.

Impact
loss of integrity : removed users still have access to delete chats and contacts.
Data Loss for the Organization : Deleted users still have access to do actions on the org.
loss of Availability : removed users still can make the ORG resources unavailable.
